SUMMARY:Tooleys café (Mon Coffee)
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nCome out to socialize and enjoy a good cup 
 of coffee at Tooleys cafe\nWe will be meeting every Monday from 9:30 - 10:
 30.\nTooleys Café.\n1729 Brevard Rd\, Laurel Park\,\nIn the Laurel Park V
 illage Shopping Mall.\n**Please keep your RSVP's updated\; I need to let t
 he staff know how many chairs to 'reserve'.**\nHome-cooked style menu\; fa
 mily owned. ($$)\nOpen 9 AM-3 PM weekdays\nTooley's Cafe is a cozy spot in
  the Laurel Park Village Shopping Mall\, offering a variety of menu items\
 , fast and friendly service\, and daily specials. The restaurant is known 
 for its reliably good food\, including its signature turkey sandwich and s
 ides. Breakfast and lunch are served\, with a familiar yet varied menu.\nM
 enu\n[https://places.singleplatform.com/tooleys-cafe-2/menu?ref=google](ht
 tps://places.singleplatform.com/tooleys-cafe-2/menu?ref=google)\n[https://
 restaurantguru.com/Tooleys-Cafe-Hendersonville](https://restaurantguru.com
 /Tooleys-Cafe-Hendersonville)\n[https://www.yelp.com/biz/tooleys-cafe-hend
 ersonville](https://www.yelp.com/biz/tooleys-cafe-hendersonville)\nI perso
 nally recommend the Rhubarb-Strawberry Homemade pie !!!!
