SUMMARY:Domino Game Afternoon (3rd Wed.)
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nEvery 1st & 3rd Wed.\nYou are convivially i
 nvited to an evening of raucous laughter and abandon while playing (a simp
 lified) **Mule Train Wreck Dominoes**.\nThis event is for beginners and/or
  for those who do *NOT* take gaming seriously. This is a ‘social’ even
 t.\nThose who do NOT know how to play always win !!!!\nThere will be no 
 ‘Book of Hoyle’. There will be no ‘scorekeeping’. Bring yo' funnyb
 one!! **ENTRY FEE**: Free\n***Doors open at 3 PM***\nEnjoy a large\, clima
 te-controlled indoor area.\nAsst’d beers\, wines\, water & soft drinks a
 vailable.\nA Food Truck is usually available\n**You are encouraged to purc
 hase drink at the venue.**\n**Optional:** You may bring (non-messy) finger
  food. (to share if you like).\ngordie's contact: CurmudgeonHiker@gmail.co
 m\n828.393.0297 (text only)\nMy simplified version of "Mule Train Dominoes
 " was developed by cheating during the long cold Winters of Wisconsin. The
  altered ‘rules’ remove all chance of strategy. Play is controlled by 
 luck\, happenchance and coincidence.\nGame play will be explained as succi
 nctly as a Curmudgeon is able.\nPlease keep your RSVP’s up to date.
