SUMMARY:National POW/MIA Recognition Day
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nIn honor of National POW/MIA Recognition Da
 y\, Hedrick-Rhodes VFW Post 5206 will present a talk about Henderson Count
 y's 14 Mission in Action service members and the Post's efforts to bring t
 hem home.\nTalk will be by VFW Post 5206's Commander\, retired Army Major 
 Bob Johnson
