DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nCome sing along with music from the 50's-70
 's.\n\nThey have beer\, wine\, cider and a variety of other drinks. There'
 s a food truck on site. Their store offers local products\, cheese\, jam. 
 Hand made crafts. They're very reasonably priced and it's a cozy spot to c
 ome hang out with friends.\n\nHope to see you here the third Friday of eac
 h month.
